A first-block plus refuses a follower at an intervening column

```
- > +
 b
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <blockquote>

    </blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>b</p>
```

```
- a
  - > +
 b
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <ul>
      <li>
        <blockquote>

        </blockquote>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>b</p>
```

